{"loop_id":"PU_1993_FEEDBACK_MARIO_KART","subject":"Super Mario Kart","statement":"Bjorn scores Super Mario Kart 6.5 in issue 1. Issue 2 publishes reader disagreement. Issue 4 explicitly says the earlier judgement produced many angry reactions and revisits the game in Eeuwig Leven. No replacement score is printed, so this is a re-evaluation framing rather than a score correction.","epistemic_status":"DIRECT_SEQUENCE_WITH_CAUSAL_LANGUAGE_IN_SOURCE","evidence":[{"issue_id":"PU_001","pdf_pages":[55,55],"layer":"PU_001_CONSOLIDATED_REVIEW_CANON_v1.1","year_review_id":"PU_1993_REVIEW_028","source_record_id":"PU_001_CONSOLIDATED_028","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_002","pdf_page":11,"layer":"PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS","source_file":"auth/PU2/PU_002_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_002_PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS.jsonl","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_004","pdf_pages":[67],"layer":"ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE","knowledge_id":"PU_004_KNOW_032","source_file":"PU4/PU_004_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_004_ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE.jsonl","source_authority":"DIRECT_ISSUE_TEXT","note":null}]}
{"loop_id":"PU_1993_FEEDBACK_LOST_VIKINGS","subject":"The Lost Vikings","statement":"The Lost Vikings becomes a months-long reader/editor knowledge loop: the issue 2 review is followed by issue 3 reader-supplied endgame codes after Bjorn became stuck, issue 4 reader complaints about promised codes, and issue 5 another reader solution for level 38.","epistemic_status":"DIRECT_CROSS_ISSUE_CONTINUITY","evidence":[{"issue_id":"PU_002","pdf_page":24,"layer":"PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS","source_file":"auth/PU2/PU_002_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_002_PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS.jsonl","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_003","pdf_page":66,"layer":"PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS","source_file":"PU3/PU_003_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_003_PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS.jsonl","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_004","pdf_pages":[9],"layer":"ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE","knowledge_id":"PU_004_KNOW_004","source_file":"PU4/PU_004_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_004_ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE.jsonl","source_authority":"DIRECT_ISSUE_TEXT","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_005","pdf_page":69,"layer":"PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS","source_file":"PU5/PU_005_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_005_PAGE_TRANSCRIPTS.jsonl","note":null}]}
{"loop_id":"PU_1993_FEEDBACK_ASTERIX_REQUEST","subject":"Asterix","statement":"Issue 3 records a reader request asking PU to put Asterix on Super NES in that very issue; the issue contains scored Asterix evaluations. This shows the letters layer and review layer intersecting, although timing does not prove the letter caused the review.","epistemic_status":"COINCIDENCE_OR_POSSIBLE_EDITORIAL_RESPONSE_NOT_PROVEN","evidence":[{"issue_id":"PU_003","pdf_pages":[9],"layer":"ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE","knowledge_id":"PU_003_KNOW_005","source_file":"PU3/PU_003_COMPLETE_INGEST/PU_003_ISSUE_KNOWLEDGE.jsonl","source_authority":"DIRECT_ISSUE_TEXT","note":null},{"issue_id":"PU_003","pdf_pages":[24,25],"layer":"HUMAN_CANON_REVIEWS","year_review_id":"PU_1993_REVIEW_087","source_record_id":"PU_003_REVIEW_003","note":null}]}
